  "aiContextParagraph": "Indonesian President Prabowo Subianto has been actively participating in back-to-back international summits, including the APEC summit in Shenzhen and the ASEAN summit in Manila. During the APEC gala dinner, the President was noted for sitting alongside Russian President Vladimir Putin, with the two leaders holding subsequent bilateral discussions. In Manila, the focus of the Indonesian delegation shifted toward long-term strategic goals, specifically the promotion of food security and the acceleration of domestic bioethanol production. The summits also served as a venue for diplomatic interactions with other global figures, such as United States President Donald Trump and Chinese President Xi Jinping. As the ASEAN summit concluded, preparations for the upcoming leadership transition in 2027 were formalized, with Singapore set to assume the chair position following the completion of the 49th summit events.",
